<resources>
    <!-- MARSOUD-MOBILE-BRANDING (2026-08-25) — the label drawn under the
         launcher icon. Deliberately the SHORT form: Android gives a home
         -screen label roughly 11-12 characters before it ellipsises, so
         the full "مرصود – Marsoud" (15) would render as "مرصود – Mars…".
         The full name belongs on the Play listing title, which allows 30
         characters and is what users read in the store. -->
    <string name="app_name">مرصود</string>
</resources>
